storage/
# ...except the seeded category shop photographs. Migration 014 names these files, so a deploy
# that does not carry them leaves the rail full of broken images. Everything the shopkeeper
# uploads lands in a dated folder beside this one and stays ignored, as an upload should.
#
# Git will not look inside a directory it has excluded, so each step of the path has to be let
# through and its other contents re-excluded — that is what the alternating lines below do.
!apps/api/storage/
apps/api/storage/*
!apps/api/storage/uploads/
apps/api/storage/uploads/*
!apps/api/storage/uploads/categories/
apps/api/storage/uploads/categories/*
!apps/api/storage/uploads/categories/seed/
*.tsbuildinfo
.DS_Store
apps/mobile/android/app/build/
apps/mobile/ios/Pods/
firebase-service-account*.json
test-results/
playwright-report/

